// The same query as ../allocation_by_department_year.dax on the hidden plain (naive) form of the measure, so that before and after run the same query.
// Slow measure 3, plain form, shaped like a table (the widest grid the page can draw): the Allocated Amount by department of the
// current structure and financial year.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    'Department (current structure)'[Department Number],
    "allocated", [Allocated Amount (naive)]
)
ORDER BY 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year], 'Department (current structure)'[Department Number]
